~ missing_items
CraftingStation: You don't have the required items to craft a bomb.
=> END

~ has_all_items
CraftingStation: You have the required items to craft a bomb. Would you like to combine them?
CraftingStation:
- Craft bomb
	set GlobalDialoguesState.Lab_CraftingStation = 1
	CraftingStation: You craft a bomb and place it in your inventory.
- Keep items
	set GlobalDialoguesState.Lab_CraftingStation = 0
=> END


